<title>USA: Virginia College Building $53 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Virginia College Building $53 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said Tuesday it repriced and restructured a $53 million of Virginia College Building Authority educational facilities revenue bonds, Series 1996, for the 21st Century College Program, cutting the top yield to 5.40 percent from 5.43 percent in 2016.</p>
